MCTAL probe: a bare U-235 sphere in KCODE, with perturbations and detectors
c Not exact like probe.mcnp: this fixes the layout of what only a run with
c materials writes (the kcode block, perturbation values, detectors).
c Regenerate with: mcnp6 i=kcode.mcnp n=kcode.
1 1 -18.7  -1 imp:n=1
2 0         1 -2 imp:n=1
3 0         2 imp:n=0

1 SO 8.7
2 SO 30

MODE N
M1 92235.30c 1
KCODE 500 1.0 3 8
KSRC 0 0 0
PRDMP 2j 1
FC4 flux in the sphere, with energy bins
F4:N 1
E4 1e-3 1 20
FC14 energy-weighted
*F14:N 1
FC5 point detectors
F5:N 20 0 0 0.5  0 20 0 0.5
FC15 ring detector
F15X:N 10 15 0.5
FC6 heating, all particles
+F6 1
PERT1:N CELL=1 RHO=-18.0
PERT2:N CELL=1 RHO=-19.4
